the palette's names and hints:
  save | Save | [Ctrl S]
  undo | Undo | [Ctrl Z]
  redo | Redo | [Ctrl Shift Z]
  tab | Next tab | [Ctrl Tab]
  findprev | Find previous | [Shift F3]
  find | Find | [F3]
  build | Build | [F5]
  bigger | Bigger text | [Ctrl =]
  themes | Color theme... | []
  first | First wins | [Ctrl Q]
  second | Second loses | [Ctrl Q]
keys:
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 115 -> [save]
  ctrl 1 shift 1 key 115 -> [save]
  ctrl 0 shift 0 key 115 -> []
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 122 -> [undo]
  ctrl 1 shift 1 key 122 -> [redo]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 121 -> [redo]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 9 -> [tab]
  ctrl 1 shift 1 key 9 -> [tab]
  ctrl 0 shift 0 key 1000 -> [find]
  ctrl 0 shift 1 key 1000 -> [findprev]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 1000 -> []
  ctrl 0 shift 0 key 1001 -> [build]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 1001 -> []
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 61 -> [bigger]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 43 -> [bigger]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 112 -> [commands]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 113 -> [first]
  ctrl 1 shift 0 key 999 -> []
  ctrl 0 shift 0 key 0 -> []
